ped with the most advanced Bluetooth 5.2 chip in the market. It enables the integration of the latest audio technologies and improves significantly the quality of the Intercom. Bluetooth 5.2 is also more efficient and more secure, it offers faster pairing capabilities, as well as longer battery life. UNIVERSAL CONNECTIVITY – Connects with any other Bluetooth headset of any brand. AUTOMATIC VOLUME – Automatically adjusts your sound volume based on the outside ambient noise. 3 YEAR WARRANTY – Extended 3 year warranty for your peace of mind. MUSIC STREAMING – All the music you ever wanted streamed directly from your smartphone. Control, share and experience your favorite tune on the road. FM RADIO – Built-in FM Radio with RDS for automatic selection of the strongest signal – whether you are in town, or in the middle of nowhere. OVER-THE-AIR SOFTWARE / UPDATES – Keeping your unit up-to-date has never been so easy. Use your Cardo Connect App to download and install latest software directly to your PACKTALK EDGE. No cables needed. PHONE \\u0026 GPS – Make calls and control your GPS with a touch of a finger or the sound of your voice. FAST CHARGING – Running out of Battery? Get 2 hours talk time battery after 20 minutes of charging. USB TYPE C – Robust and universal USB type C for easy connections to any device. CONTROL ROLLER – Extra convenience and control, all in one small roller. Experience the edge, PACKTALK EDGE! Highlights Magnetic air mount – bring your PACKTALK EDGE near the magnetic mount and it will snap right onWaterproofNatural Voice Operation – just say “Hey Cardo” and tell it what you want, your PACKTALK EDGE will do the restSound by JBL – powerful 40mm high-definition speakers, an improved music processor and three redesigned audio profilesDynamic Mesh Communication Gen 2 – unparalleled intercom sound quality, easy pairing, and robust performance. For up to 15 riders at a range of up to 1.6km/1miBluetooth 5.2 – more efficient, more secure, it offers faster pairing capabilities, as well as longer battery lifeUniversal connectivity42:Td54,World’s best, fully featured, Bluetooth communicator for up to 4 riders, with Sound by JBL, Live Intercom, Natural Voice Operation and tons of other amazing features! All you ever wanted from a high-end motorcycle intercom. Product Description Cardo FREECOM 4x – All you ever wanted from a high-end motorcycle intercom – with Sound by JBL, Live intercom for up to 4 riders, Natural Voice Operation, and tons of other amazing features. The FREECOM 4x is a rider-to-rider communicator with an 1200m range, equipped with 40 mm HD JBL speakers \\u0026 JBL sound profiles, USB type C, Bluetooth 5.2, 13 hours talk time with fast charging, FM radio, and a two-year warranty. A waterproof, jog-dial and over-the-air software updates provide additional value to an already incredible package. The World’s best Bluetooth communicator! LIVE INTERCOM – Live sound. Live Connection. Experience exceptional audio quality with Cardo’s all-new auto-reconnecting Bluetooth intercom. For 4 riders at a range of up to 1.2km /0.75mi. SOUND BY JBL – Powerful 40mm high-definition speakers engineered to perfection by JBL experts, with specially tuned music processor and three distinctive audio profiles to make your riding experience exceptional. WATERPROOF – No matter what you throw at it, your waterproof FREECOM 4x will take the beating and keep you connected. Rain, shine, mud, dust or snow. OPERATED BY NATURAL VOICE – Keep your eyes on the road and your hands on the bars. Our always-on natural voice operation engine makes button-pressing a thing of the past.Just say “hey Cardo” and tell it what you want, your FREECOM 4x will do the rest. OVER THE AIR SOFTWARE UPDATES – Keeping your unit up-to-date has never been so easy. Use your Cardo Connect App to download and install latest software directly to your FREECOM 4x. No cables needed. UNIVERSAL CONNECTIVITY – FREECOM 4x connects with any other Bluetooth headset of any brand. AUTOMATIC VOLUME – Automatically adjusts your sound volume based on the outside ambient noise. FM RADIO – Built-in FM Radio with RDS for automatic selection of the strongest signal – whether you are in town, or in the middle of nowhere. MUSIC STREAMING – All the music you ever wanted streamed directly from your smartphone. Control, share and experience your favorite tune on the road. PHONE \\u0026 GPS – Make calls and control your GPS with a touch of a finger or the sound of your voice. FAST CHARGING – Running out of Battery? Get 2 hours talk time battery after 20 minutes of charging. USB TYPE C – Robust and universal USB type C for easy connections to any device. CONTROL WHEEL – Extra convenience and control, all in one small wheel. BLUETOOTH 5.2 – Your unit is equipped with the most advanced Bluetooth 5.2 chip in the market. It enables the integration of the latest audio technologies and improves significantly the quality of the Intercom. Bluetooth 5.2 is also more efficient and more secure, it offers faster pairing capabilities, as well as longer battery life. Highlights 1200m Range – BT Intercom. For up to 4 riders at a range of up to 1.2km /0.75mi.Powerful 40mm HD JBL speakers, specially tuned music processor and 3 distinctive audio profilesWaterproofNatural Voice Operation – Just say “hey Cardo” and tell it what you want, your FREECOM 4x will do the rest.Universal connectivityOver-the-Air Software updatesBuilt-in FM Radio43:Tb21,World’s best, Bluetooth communicator for 2 riders, with Sound by JBL, Live Intercom, an analog jog dial and tons of other amazing features! Product Description Cardo FREECOM 2x – The World’s best Bluetooth communicator. Equipped with Sound by JBL and the latest Bluetooth technology, Freecom 2x introduces Live Intercom, an auto-reconnecting Bluetooth connection for two riders, with live sound like never before. A waterproof, jog-dial and over-the-air software updates provide additional value to an already incredible package. The FREECOM 2x is a rider-to-rider communicator with an 800-meter range, equipped with 40 mm JBL speakers \\u0026 JBL sound profiles, USB type C, Bluetooth 5.2, 13 hours talk time with fast charging, FM radio, and a two-year warranty. LIVE INTERCOM – Live sound. Live Connection. Experience exceptional audio quality with our all new auto-reconnect Bluetooth intercom. For 2 riders at a range of 800m/0.5mi. SOUND BY JBL – Powerful 40mm high-definition speakers engineered to perfection by JBL experts, with specially tuned music processor and 3 distinctive audio profiles, will make your riding experience exceptional. WATERPROOF – No matter what you throw at it, your waterproof FREECOM 2x will take the beating and keep you connected. Rain, shine, mud, dust or snow. OVER THE AIR SOFTWARE UPDATE – Keeping your unit up-to-date has never been so easy. Use your Cardo Connect App to download and install latest software directly to your FREECOM 2x. No cables needed. UNIVERSAL CONNECTIVITY – FREECOM 2x connects with any other Bluetooth headset of any brand. FM RADIO – Built-in FM Radio with RDS for automatic selection of the strongest signal – whether you are in town, or in the middle of nowhere. MUSIC STREAMING – All the music you ever wanted streamed directly from your smartphone. Control, share and experience your favorite tune on the road. PHONE \\u0026 GPS – Make calls and control your GPS with a touch of a finger or the sound of your voice. FAST CHARGING – Running out of Battery? Get 2 hours talk time battery after 20 minutes of charging. USB TYPE C – Robust and universal USB type C for easy connections to any device. CONTROL WHEEL – Extra convenience and control, all in one small wheel. BLUETOOTH 5.2 – Your unit is equipped with the most advanced Bluetooth 5.2 chip in the market. It enables the integration of the latest audio technologies and improves significantly the quality of the Intercom. Bluetooth 5.2 is also more efficient and more secure, it offers faster pairing capabilities, as well as longer battery life. Highlights 800m Range – 2-way BT intercom. Two riders at a range of 800m/0.5mi.Powerful 40mm HD JBL speakers, specially tuned music processor and 3 distinctive audio profilesWaterproofUniversal connectivityOver-the-Air Software updatesBuilt-in FM Radio\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"44:T652,Upgrade to the ultimate sound experience with this JBL 45mm set \\u0026 matching software Product Description Upgrade to the ultimate sound experience with this JBL 45mm set \\u0026 matching software. Get premium sound with large 45mm high-definition speakers engineered by JBL experts. It also has 3 JBL designed audio profiles. With a standard 3.5mm jack, these speakers fit practically any communicator on the market, no matter what brand. Owners of Cardo FREECOM and PACKTALK series will enjoy extra boost with new JBL sound processor and firmware. Not a FREECOM or PACKTALK owner? No worries: this powerful hardware will still drive your headset audio performance to new heights. Achieving good audio quality inside a motorcycle helmet is demanding. The wind, the road, the engine and the type of helmet, all affect the frequencies you hear. With that in mind, these 45 mm speakers combine the sound only a large diameter driver can provide, with a narrow, 42 mm base that can fit almost every modern helmet. Compatible with the Cardo PACKTALK line, Cardo FREECOM X line and the Cardo SPIRIT line. Highlights Get premium sound with large 45mm high-definition speakersCompatible with any headset equipped with a standard 3.5mm audio jack3 JBL designed audio profilesHas a narrow, 42mm base that can fit almost every modern helmetCompatible with the Cardo PACKTALK line, Cardo FREECOM X line and the Cardo SPIRIT line What’s in the box? Cardo Accessory – JBL 45mm HD Speakers x 1 SetThis Set includes the following:45mm Audio Set x 1Square Velcro Pads x 2Speaker Repositioning Pads x 2Replaceable Covers x 2Activation Guide45:T4f5,Audio kit with a flexible, extra-long boom microphone designed for mounting unit on half helmets. Product Description Cardo Systems brings you the FREECOM-X / SPIRIT – Half Helmet Kit. This is an audio kit with a flexible extra-long boom microphone designed for mounting unit on half helmets, ski-helmets and other non-motorcycle helmets. It also comes with a cradle and all required mounting gear. It has an adaptable mount. The cradle is attached by mounting clamp on narrow rim helmets, or glue plate on wide helmets. Its easy to install. Complete manual included with the kit. Compatible with the FREECOM 4x, FREECOM 2x, SPIRIT \\u0026 SPIRIT HD Bluetooth communicators. Bluetooth communicator, speakers and speaker pockets are not included. Users of half helmets with no speaker pockets need to purchase them separately. Highlights Designed for mounting unit on half helmetsFlexible, extra-long boom microphone for perfect adjustmentCompatible with the FREECOM 4x, FREECOM 2x, SPIRIT \\u0026 SPIRIT HD Bluetooth communicatorsEasy installation What’s in the box? CARDO ACCESSORY – FREECOM-X / SPIRIT – HALF HELMET KIT x 1The Kit includes the following:Cradle with flexible boom microphone x 1Glue Plate x 1Mounting Clamp x 1Spare Microphone Sponge x 1Installation Guide46:T697,Now enjoy the exceptional JBL sound on your 2nd helmet! Product Description: Cardo Systems brings you the FREECOM-X / SPIRIT – 2nd Helmet JBL Kit. Now enjoy the exceptional JBL sound on your 2nd helmet! Key features include: 40mm JBL Speakers: The unit has powerful 40mm high-definition speakers engineered by JBL experts. JBL Sound Profiles: 3 JBL designed audio profiles. Boom or Wired Microphone: Interchangeable boom and wired microphones included. Easy Installation: Complete manual and links to videos included. Suitable for all helmets: Except half-helmets (Kit sold separately) Compatible with the FREECOM 4x, FREECOM 2x, SPIRIT \\u0026 SPIRIT HD Bluetooth communicators Highlights: JBL speaker kit for your 2nd helmet Powerful 40mm high-definition JBL speakers; 3 JBL designed audio profiles Interchangeable boom and wired microphones included Compatible with the FREECOM 4x, FREECOM 2x, SPIRIT \\u0026 SPIRIT HD Bluetooth communicators Easy installation What’s in the box? CARDO ACCESSORY – FREECOM-X / SPIRIT – 2ND HELMET JBL KIT x 1 40mm JBL Speakers x 1 set FREECOM/SPIRIT Cradle with Clamp x 1 Glue Plate x 1 Boom Microphone x 1 Wired Microphone x 1 Speaker Booster Pads x Rectangular Velcros x 2 Round Velcros x 2 Alcohol Pads Installation Guide JBL Activation Guide How to activate the JBL QR code?(For SPIRIT/SPIRIT HD users) Step 1: Install the latest Software update on your Cardo UnitStep 2: Download the Cardo Connect AppStep 3: Pair your mobile phone with your Cardo unitStep 4: Open the Cardo Connect AppStep 5: Press SettingsStep 6: Press Audio ProfilesStep 7: Press Scan QR Code to activate the QR CodeStep 8: Scan the QR Code printed inside your JBL Activation Card47:T46d,EJEAS Q8 Motorcycle Mesh Intercom 6 Riders Group Talking at The Same Time Feature: Mesh 3.0, Bluetooth 5.1, 2-6 People Talk Simultaneously, Unlimited Listeners, Intercom Distance 600-1000m, Music Sharing, Microphone Mute, Waterproof IP67 Mesh 3.0Robust \\u0026 reliable communication network. 6 people can talk at the same time. Bluetooth 5.1Compatible with the Bluetooth 5.1 platform. Unlimited ListenersIn the case that other intercoms have formed a team, you can become the listener of the team through pairing. Multi-Channel CommunicationCommunicate with different groups across 5 channels. Intercom Range 1 kmMaximum distance operating within optimal conditions. Strong PenetrationIt has strong penetrating power and stable signals in environments with obstacles such as tunnels, steep slopes, and curves. Advanced Noise ControlThe noise reduction capability is enhanced, and the sound quality remains clear even if the vehicle speed increases. Audio MultitaskingSupports common sound, intercom, and music, intercom and FM can be performed at the same time. Microphone MuteSupports microphone mute, suitable for more demand scenarios.48:Tc34,Key Features of EJAS V6 Pro+ 2024 Upgraded Model IP67 Certified Waterproof Device (Working temprature 10-50 degree celcius). Intercom Distance 800m Bluetooth 5.1 (High Speed Transmission, Stronger Signal, Quick Connect, BLE uses less power) Listen to GPS Navigation 25 Hours of Music Listing Time CVC noise reduction Supports connection 2 mobile phones via bluetooth Automatically answer incoming calls Standby time 260 Hours Support Safe Riding App Support official EJAS website firmware upgrade Intercom Time - 18 Hours New C Type Interface (3 in one - Headphone, Charging ad software upgrade). Supports Pairing EUC Controller Supports 6 people pairing, 2 People can talk at the same time This is the new and latest updated EJAS V6 Pro+ Bluetooth Intercom by EJAS Company. You get officially 6 months warranty on device. (Note- Warranty is not on speakers, its only on main intercom device) Two riders can talk at the same time. One main device has switched intercom with 5 sub-devices, and the main device can choose to talk to 1 sub-device. Intercom distance - 800 meters. - Built in high-performance antenna good signal stablity, provides you with a safe, efficient and convinient helmet communication system. CVC Noise reduction technology automatically identifies environmental noise. Through powerfull intelligent CVC noise reduction technology, you can hear every voice clearly even when driving at high speed. Safe Riding Mobile App gives functions of adding friends, initiating intercom groups, music control, shutdown, check authenticity and many more. Each device comes with its serial number which is mentioned behind the bluetooth intercom unit. You can register your device on Safe Riding App to check authenticity of the product. Warranty Policy by EJAS Shenzhen EJEAS Technology Co., Ltd. (“EJEAS”) warrants that this product (“Product”) shall conform to and perform in accordance with published technical specifications and the accompanying written materials, and shall be free of defects in materials. The devices have a Warranty Period of 6 months from the date of purchase by the first consumer purchaser of this product. The warranty period of different platforms may be different, and the warranty period of the purchased platform shall prevail. This warranty is limited to the repair and/or replacement, at EJEAS’s discretion, of defective or non-conforming Product, and EJEAS shall not be responsible for the failure of the Product to perform specified functions, or any other non-conformance caused by or attributable to:(a) any misapplication or misuse of the Product;(b) failure of Customer to adhere to any of EJEAS’s specifications or instructions;(c) complementary equipment or software not furnished by EJEAS. Limited warranty service may be obtained by delivering the Product to EJEAS or to the international distributor it was purchased through, and providing proof of purchase or dated receipt. Customer agrees to insure the Product or assume the risk of loss or damage in transit, to prepay shipping charges to EJEAS, and to use the original shipping container or equivalent.49:T419,Sleek. Smart. Built for the Ride. The SIMTAC M10 Motorcycle Navigation System brings together essential riding features — GPS navigation with Android Auto/Apple CarPlay, dual HD video recording, waterproof durability, and a glove-ready display — all in a compact 5.5” form. It’s designed for riders who demand clarity, control, and convenience in one powerful unit. Key Features at a Glance: Android Auto \\u0026 Apple CarPlay Dual HD Cameras (Front + Rear) Glove-Friendly 5.5″ Touchscreen IP67 Water \\u0026 Dust Resistant Wired Handlebar Remote Included USB Type-C Connector 1-Year Warranty Why Choose SIMTAC M10?For the everyday rider and weekend explorer — M10 offers the right blend of tech, toughness, and touch, without overwhelming you with extras. Wallet Discounts EMI Options Free Shipping Across India ⇒ Package Contents SIMTAC M10 Navigation Unit (1 Nos.) Wired Handlebar Remote (1 Nos.) HD Front Camera (1 Nos.) HD Rear Camera (1 Nos.) Mounting Bracket with Fittings USB Type-C Power Cable \\u0026 Wiring Harness User Manual \\u0026 Warranty Card4a:T4ff,Navigate smarter, capture every mile, and stay connected with the SIMTAC M6 Motorcycle Navigation System.Engineered for modern riders, the M6 combines turn-by-turn navigation with Android Auto/Apple CarPlay, HD dual-camera recording, and TPMS safety monitoring — all packed into a glove-friendly, weather-resistant touchscreen unit. With seamless connectivity, wired remote access, and durable construction, this all-in-one ride companion enhances safety, convenience, and adventure on every journey. Whether you’re touring the Himalayas or navigating daily commutes — trust the M6 to guide and guard every ride. Key Features: Smart Navigation with Android Auto \\u0026 CarPlay Dual HD Cameras (Front + Rear) Real-Time TPMS Monitoring Glove-Friendly Touchscreen IP67 Water \\u0026 Dust Resistant Wired Handlebar Remote 12 Months Warranty Why Choose Simtac M6? Because real adventures demand more than just maps — they need visibility, safety, and total control at your fingertips. Wallet Discounts EMI Options Free Shipping Across India ⇒ Package Contents SIMTAC M6 Navigation System (1 Nos.) Wired Remote Control (1 Nos.) Front HD Camera (1 Nos.) Rear HD Camera (1 Nos.) TPMS Sensors (2 Nos.) Mounting Bracket \\u0026 Fittings Power Cable \\u0026 Connection Harness User Manual \\u0026 Warranty Car24:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\