processor and firmware. Not a FREECOM or PACKTALK owner? No worries: this powerful hardware will still drive your headset audio performance to new heights. Achieving good audio quality inside a motorcycle helmet is demanding. The wind, the road, the engine and the type of helmet, all affect the frequencies you hear. With that in mind, these 45 mm speakers combine the sound only a large diameter driver can provide, with a narrow, 42 mm base that can fit almost every modern helmet. Compatible with the Cardo PACKTALK line, Cardo FREECOM X line and the Cardo SPIRIT line. Highlights Get premium sound with large 45mm high-definition speakersCompatible with any headset equipped with a standard 3.5mm audio jack3 JBL designed audio profilesHas a narrow, 42mm base that can fit almost every modern helmetCompatible with the Cardo PACKTALK line, Cardo FREECOM X line and the Cardo SPIRIT line What’s in the box? Cardo Accessory – JBL 45mm HD Speakers x 1 SetThis Set includes the following:45mm Audio Set x 1Square Velcro Pads x 2Speaker Repositioning Pads x 2Replaceable Covers x 2Activation Guide45:T4f5,Audio kit with a flexible, extra-long boom microphone designed for mounting unit on half helmets. Product Description Cardo Systems brings you the FREECOM-X / SPIRIT – Half Helmet Kit. This is an audio kit with a flexible extra-long boom microphone designed for mounting unit on half helmets, ski-helmets and other non-motorcycle helmets. It also comes with a cradle and all required mounting gear. It has an adaptable mount. The cradle is attached by mounting clamp on narrow rim helmets, or glue plate on wide helmets. Its easy to install. Complete manual included with the kit. Compatible with the FREECOM 4x, FREECOM 2x, SPIRIT & SPIRIT HD Bluetooth communicators. Bluetooth communicator, speakers and speaker pockets are not included. Users of half helmets with no speaker pockets need to purchase them separately. Highlights Designed for mounting unit on half helmetsFlexible, extra-long boom microphone for perfect adjustmentCompatible with the FREECOM 4x, FREECOM 2x, SPIRIT & SPIRIT HD Bluetooth communicatorsEasy installation What’s in the box? CARDO ACCESSORY – FREECOM-X / SPIRIT – HALF HELMET KIT x 1The Kit includes the following:Cradle with flexible boom microphone x 1Glue Plate x 1Mounting Clamp x 1Spare Microphone Sponge x 1Installation Guide46:T697,Now enjoy the exceptional JBL sound on your 2nd helmet! Product Description: Cardo Systems brings you the FREECOM-X / SPIRIT – 2nd Helmet JBL Kit. Now enjoy the exceptional JBL sound on your 2nd helmet! Key features include: 40mm JBL Speakers: The unit has powerful 40mm high-definition speakers engineered by JBL experts. JBL Sound Profiles: 3 JBL designed audio profiles. Boom or Wired Microphone: Interchangeable boom and wired microphones included. Easy Installation: Complete manual and links to videos included. Suitable for all helmets: Except half-helmets (Kit sold separately) Compatible with the FREECOM 4x, FREECOM 2x, SPIRIT & SPIRIT HD Bluetooth communicators Highlights: JBL speaker kit for your 2nd helmet Powerful 40mm high-definition JBL speakers; 3 JBL designed audio profiles Interchangeable boom and wired microphones included Compatible with the FREECOM 4x, FREECOM 2x, SPIRIT & SPIRIT HD Bluetooth communicators Easy installation What’s in the box? CARDO ACCESSORY – FREECOM-X / SPIRIT – 2ND HELMET JBL KIT x 1 40mm JBL Speakers x 1 set FREECOM/SPIRIT Cradle with Clamp x 1 Glue Plate x 1 Boom Microphone x 1 Wired Microphone x 1 Speaker Booster Pads x Rectangular Velcros x 2 Round Velcros x 2 Alcohol Pads Installation Guide JBL Activation Guide How to activate the JBL QR code?(For SPIRIT/SPIRIT HD users) Step 1: Install the latest Software update on your Cardo UnitStep 2: Download the Cardo Connect AppStep 3: Pair your mobile phone with your Cardo unitStep 4: Open the Cardo Connect AppStep 5: Press SettingsStep 6: Press Audio ProfilesStep 7: Press Scan QR Code to activate the QR CodeStep 8: Scan the QR Code printed inside your JBL Activation Card47:T46d,EJEAS Q8 Motorcycle Mesh Intercom 6 Riders Group Talking at The Same Time Feature: Mesh 3.0, Bluetooth 5.1, 2-6 People Talk Simultaneously, Unlimited Listeners, Intercom Distance 600-1000m, Music Sharing, Microphone Mute, Waterproof IP67 Mesh 3.0Robust & reliable communication network. 6 people can talk at the same time. Bluetooth 5.1Compatible with the Bluetooth 5.1 platform. Unlimited ListenersIn the case that other intercoms have formed a team, you can become the listener of the team through pairing. Multi-Channel CommunicationCommunicate with different groups across 5 channels. Intercom Range 1 kmMaximum distance operating within optimal conditions. Strong PenetrationIt has strong penetrating power and stable signals in environments with obstacles such as tunnels, steep slopes, and curves. Advanced Noise ControlThe noise reduction capability is enhanced, and the sound quality remains clear even if the vehicle speed increases. Audio MultitaskingSupports common sound, intercom, and music, intercom and FM can be performed at the same time. Microphone MuteSupports microphone mute, suitable for more demand scenarios.48:Tc34,Key Features of EJAS V6 Pro+ 2024 Upgraded Model IP67 Certified Waterproof Device (Working temprature 10-50 degree celcius). Intercom Distance 800m Bluetooth 5.1 (High Speed Transmission, Stronger Signal, Quick Connect, BLE uses less power) Listen to GPS Navigation 25 Hours of Music Listing Time CVC noise reduction Supports connection 2 mobile phones via bluetooth Automatically answer incoming calls Standby time 260 Hours Support Safe Riding App Support official EJAS website firmware upgrade Intercom Time - 18 Hours New C Type Interface (3 in one - Headphone, Charging ad software upgrade). Supports Pairing EUC Controller Supports 6 people pairing, 2 People can talk at the same time This is the new and latest updated EJAS V6 Pro+ Bluetooth Intercom by EJAS Company. You get officially 6 months warranty on device. (Note- Warranty is not on speakers, its only on main intercom device) Two riders can talk at the same time. One main device has switched intercom with 5 sub-devices, and the main device can choose to talk to 1 sub-device. Intercom distance - 800 meters. - Built in high-performance antenna good signal stablity, provides you with a safe, efficient and convinient helmet communication system. CVC Noise reduction technology automatically identifies environmental noise. Through powerfull intelligent CVC noise reduction technology, you can hear every voice clearly even when driving at high speed. Safe Riding Mobile App gives functions of adding friends, initiating intercom groups, music control, shutdown, check authenticity and many more. Each device comes with its serial number which is mentioned behind the bluetooth intercom unit. You can register your device on Safe Riding App to check authenticity of the product. Warranty Policy by EJAS Shenzhen EJEAS Technology Co., Ltd. (“EJEAS”) warrants that this product (“Product”) shall conform to and perform in accordance with published technical specifications and the accompanying written materials, and shall be free of defects in materials. The devices have a Warranty Period of 6 months from the date of purchase by the first consumer purchaser of this product. The warranty period of different platforms may be different, and the warranty period of the purchased platform shall prevail. This warranty is limited to the repair and/or replacement, at EJEAS’s discretion, of defective or non-conforming Product, and EJEAS shall not be responsible for the failure of the Product to perform specified functions, or any other non-conformance caused by or attributable to:(a) any misapplication or misuse of the Product;(b) failure of Customer to adhere to any of EJEAS’s specifications or instructions;(c) complementary equipment or software not furnished by EJEAS. Limited warranty service may be obtained by delivering the Product to EJEAS or to the international distributor it was purchased through, and providing proof of purchase or dated receipt. Customer agrees to insure the Product or assume the risk of loss or damage in transit, to prepay shipping charges to EJEAS, and to use the original shipping container or equivalent.49:T419,Sleek. Smart. Built for the Ride. The SIMTAC M10 Motorcycle Navigation System brings together essential riding features — GPS navigation with Android Auto/Apple CarPlay, dual HD video recording, waterproof durability, and a glove-ready display — all in a compact 5.5” form. It’s designed for riders who demand clarity, control, and convenience in one powerful unit. Key Features at a Glance: Android Auto & Apple CarPlay Dual HD Cameras (Front + Rear) Glove-Friendly 5.5″ Touchscreen IP67 Water & Dust Resistant Wired Handlebar Remote Included USB Type-C Connector 1-Year Warranty Why Choose SIMTAC M10?For the everyday rider and weekend explorer — M10 offers the right blend of tech, toughness, and touch, without overwhelming you with extras. Wallet Discounts EMI Options Free Shipping Across India ⇒ Package Contents SIMTAC M10 Navigation Unit (1 Nos.) Wired Handlebar Remote (1 Nos.) HD Front Camera (1 Nos.) HD Rear Camera (1 Nos.) Mounting Bracket with Fittings USB Type-C Power Cable & Wiring Harness User Manual & Warranty Card4a:T4ff,Navigate smarter, capture every mile, and stay connected with the SIMTAC M6 Motorcycle Navigation System.Engineered for modern riders, the M6 combines turn-by-turn navigation with Android Auto/Apple CarPlay, HD dual-camera recording, and TPMS safety monitoring — all packed into a glove-friendly, weather-resistant touchscreen unit. With seamless connectivity, wired remote access, and durable construction, this all-in-one ride companion enhances safety, convenience, and adventure on every journey. Whether you’re touring the Himalayas or navigating daily commutes — trust the M6 to guide and guard every ride. Key Features: Smart Navigation with Android Auto & CarPlay Dual HD Cameras (Front + Rear) Real-Time TPMS Monitoring Glove-Friendly Touchscreen IP67 Water & Dust Resistant Wired Handlebar Remote 12 Months Warranty Why Choose Simtac M6? Because real adventures demand more than just maps — they need visibility, safety, and total control at your fingertips. Wallet Discounts EMI Options Free Shipping Across India ⇒ Package Contents SIMTAC M6 Navigation System (1 Nos.) Wired Remote Control (1 Nos.) Front HD Camera (1 Nos.) Rear HD Camera (1 Nos.) TPMS Sensors (2 Nos.) Mounting Bracket & Fittings Power Cable & Connection Harness User Manual & Warranty Car24:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://iranimotohub.in\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Gadgets\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://iranimotohub.in/collections/action-cameras\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"handle\":\"action-cameras\",\"initialCollection\":{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555262148925\",\"handle\":\"action-cameras\",\"title\":\"Gadgets\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/OsmoAction6_1_268b83c8-1315-4549-a9ac-3e97c156999d.jpg?v=1787337274\",\"altText\":\"Gadgets\"}},\"initialCollections\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555260772669\",\"handle\":\"air-filters\",\"title\":\"Air Filters\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/air-filter-bike.png?v=1787078101\",\"altText\":\"Air Filters\"}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555261559101\",\"handle\":\"premium-mirrors\",\"title\":\"Premium Mirrors\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/c