 & Android Auto system – M2\",\"description\":\"Navigation, Your Way Whether you’re exploring new terrains or navigating city traffic, the SIMTAC M2 Navigation Display ensures you never miss a turn. With seamless Android Auto and CarPlay, your favorite apps, calls, and directions are just a tap away — all while keeping your hands on the bars and eyes on the road. At a Glance: Android Auto & Apple CarPlay Glove-Compatible 5.0” Touchscreen IP67 All-Weather Protection 12V–36V Motorcycle Compatibility Bluetooth Audio Support 1-Year Warranty Why Choose SIMTAC M2 – 5” Version? With the SIMTAC M2 5” Navigation System, your ride is more than just a journey — it’s precision, safety, and freedom combined Package Contents SIMTAC M2 5” Navigation Display Mounting Bracket & Fittings Power & Connection Cable Harness Warranty Card\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"6500.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/M25B-1-600x600_1.jpg?v=1787060783\",\"altText\":\"Simtac motorcycle GPS CarPlay & Android Auto system – M2\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/M25B-2-1024x1024.jpg?v=1787060784\",\"altText\":\"Simtac motorcycle GPS CarPlay & Android Auto system – M2\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/M25B-3.jpg?v=1787060784\",\"altText\":\"Simtac motorcycle GPS CarPlay & Android Auto system – M2\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/M25B-4-600x600.jpg?v=1787060783\",\"altText\":\"Simtac motorcycle GPS CarPlay & Android Auto system – M2\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/M25B-5-600x600.jpg?v=1787060783\",\"altText\":\"Simtac motorcycle GPS CarPlay & Android Auto system – M2\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52881034445117\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"6500.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":{\"amount\":\"8000.0\",\"curr