-for-himalayan-452.jpg?v=1787079861\",\"altText\":\"Perfomance Lab\"}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555262509373\",\"handle\":\"crash-guards\",\"title\":\"Crash Guards\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/CRASHGUARDWHITE_jpg.jpg?v=1787079909\",\"altText\":\"Crash Guards\"}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555262607677\",\"handle\":\"auxiliary-lights\",\"title\":\"Auxiliary Lights\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/aluminium-clamp-for-fog-light-headlight-mounting-bracket-2-original-imah4kd3ygt3h98m_60bfecd2-218d-4723-8763-4d6854db4ab5.webp?v=1787079996\",\"altText\":\"Auxiliary Lights\"}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555262673213\",\"handle\":\"lubricants\",\"title\":\"Lubricants\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/Putoline_Tech_Chain_-_500ml.png?v=1787080114\",\"altText\":\"Lubricants\"}}],\"initialProducts\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/10482148376893\",\"handle\":\"sena-b20-bluetooth-intercom-communication-system\",\"title\":\"SENA B20 Bluetooth Intercom Communication System\",\"description\":\"$3\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"16999.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/1_29e83c10-bf95-49be-a78d-13a28ded60f6.png?v=1787659097\",\"altText\":\"SENA B20 Bluetooth Intercom Communication System\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/sena-b20.jpg?v=1787659096\",\"altText\":\"SENA B20 Bluetooth Intercom Communication System\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/IMG-20240902-WA0005.jpg?v=1787659096\",\"altText\":\"SENA B20 Bluetooth Intercom Communication System\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/J30_grid_waterproof-1.jpg?v=1787659096\",\"altText\":\"SENA B20 Bluetoo